# Designing Home Page using Bootstrap 🏠

## What is Bootstrap?
Bootstrap helps create **responsive and attractive web pages** with ready-made components.

### Example

```html
<div class="container mt-5 text-center">
    <h1>Welcome to TaskMate</h1>
    <p>Manage your daily tasks easily.</p>

    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
        Get Started
    </a>
</div>
```

## Key Points
- **`container`** → Centers and adds spacing.
- **`text-center`** → Centers the text.
- **`mt-5`** → Adds top margin.
- **`btn btn-primary`** → Creates a styled Bootstrap button.
- Bootstrap makes pages **responsive** and easy to design.
            
